{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["The Iridium Sprinkler is a ",["l","打造","crafted"]," item that waters the 24 adjacent tiles every morning (a 5x5 area). Only tilled tiles will be watered. The Iridium Sprinkler is unlocked at ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," level 9."]],["p",["One Iridium Sprinkler can be purchased from ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," for 10,000g every Friday. One to two Iridium Sprinklers may occasionally be found in ",["l","骷髅洞穴","treasure rooms"]," in the Skull Cavern. An Iridium Sprinkler may also randomly be a reward from ",["l","镇长的庄园","Mayor Lewis' Prize Machine"],", in exchange for a ",["l","兑奖券","Prize Ticket"],"."]],["p",["A ",["l","火把","Torch"]," can be placed on an Iridium Sprinkler to provide minimal lighting in the dark."]],["p",[["l","打造","Sprinklers"]," cannot be used to water ",["l","花盆","Garden Pot"],"s or the ",["l","动物","pet's"]," water bowl. Sprinklers cannot be placed on sand."]],["p",[["f","IridiumSprinklerExample.png",150]]]]],["Types",2,[["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Image"]},{"h":1,"v":["Name"]},{"h":1,"v":["Description"]},{"h":1,"v":["Ingredients"]},{"h":1,"v":["Recipe Source"]}],[[["f","Sprinkler.png",48]],[["l","洒水器","Sprinkler"]],["Waters the 4 adjacent tiles every morning."],[["i","(O)334","Copper Bar ×1"],["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 2"]],[[["f","Quality_Sprinkler.png",48]],[["l","优质洒水器","Quality Sprinkler"]],["Waters the 8 adjacent tiles every morning."],[["i","(O)335","Iron Bar ×1"],["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"],["i","(O)338","Refined Quartz ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 6"]],[[["f","Iridium_Sprinkler.png",48]],[["l","铱制洒水器","Iridium Sprinkler"]],["Waters the 24 adjacent tiles every morning."],[["i","(O)336","Gold Bar ×1"],["i","(O)337","Iridium Bar ×1"],["i","(O)787","Battery Pack ×1"]],[["f","Farming_Skill_Icon.png",24]," ",["l","耕种","Farming"]," Level 9"]]]]]],["Upgrades",2,[["p",["Upgrades can be attached onto a placed sprinkler. Picking 